{"articleNo":"469285","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=469285&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[장학] [근로]2024학년도 1학기 1차 국가근로장학금 학생신청 안내[2023.11.22.(수)~12.27.(수)]","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2023.11.14","hit":"64851","attachments":[{"name":"(대학용) 2024년도 1학기 1차 국가근로장학금 학생신청 매뉴얼(모바일).pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=469285&attachNo=129086"},{"name":"(대학용) 2024년도 1학기 1차 국가근로장학금 학생신청 매뉴얼(홈페이지).pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=469285&attachNo=129087"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">2024</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체;\">학년도&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체;\">학기&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체;\">차 한국장학재단 국가근로장학금 학생신청 일정을 다음과 같이 알려드리니</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">,&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체;\">참여를 희망하는 학생은 신청하시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">.</span></b><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">1.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체;\">학생신청 기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">:&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-weight: bold;\">2023.11.22.(수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-weight: bold;\">) 09:00 ~ 2023.12.27.(수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-weight: bold;\">) 18:00</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 굴림체; font-weight: bold;\">시까지</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">2.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체;\">서류제출 기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체;\">가구원 동의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">): 2023.11.22.(수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">)09:00 ~ 2024.01.03.(수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">) 18:00</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체;\">시까지</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">※ 주말 및 공휴일 포함 신청기간 내</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 10pt;\">24</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 10pt;\">시간 신청가능</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 10pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 10pt;\">단</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">,</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 10pt;\">마감일 제외</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 10pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">3.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체;\">신청대상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">: 2024-1</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체;\">학기 국가근로장학사업 참여 희망 학생</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체;\">4. 신청방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">:&nbsp;한국장학재단 홈페이지</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체;\">(www.kosaf.go.kr)</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">&nbsp;및 모바일 어플을 이용하여 신청(</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체;\">첨부파일 매뉴얼 참조)</span><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">5.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체;\">유의사항</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체;\">희망근로기관 신청 및 선발 일정은 향후 학교 홈페이지 공고 예정</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">- 국가근로장학금은 소속대학이 확정된 학생만 신청 가능&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">신(편)입생은 2차 학생신청기간 이용</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">-&nbsp;<b>2024년도 하계방학 집중근로 프로그램</b>에 참여하고자 하는 경우, 반드시&nbsp;<b>1학기 학생신청기간(1차 또는 2차)</b>에 국가근로장학금 신청</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">- 2024년도 1학기 1차 국가근로장학금 학생신청 기간동안 2023년도 2학기 봉사유형 및 취업연계유형 상시신청 불가</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체;\">사정 및 일정에 따라 변경 가능</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체;\">붙임&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">2024</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체;\">학년도&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체;\">학기 국가근로통합신청 학생매뉴얼&nbsp;각&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체;\">부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체;\">끝</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">.</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
